ツイートなど)等\n\n●参考資料\n・三面図\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/11M3eBq8VBCjqRqzTlWk_jgy3ZD1G-qcJ/view?usp=sharing\n・メインビジュアル\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1nvMHzgFUbiPgIilzxcE0xwTrsRdN_Me9/view?usp=sharing\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@strawberry0824s/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1643674b/uploads/origins/8580f4d8-57ac-4e0c-8101-7e721f9930ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d65155395b41bb288909f8aceede61d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1643674b/uploads/origins/8580f4d8-57ac-4e0c-8101-7e721f9930ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d65155395b41bb288909f8aceede61d, https://si.imgix.net/1643674b/uploads/origins/8580f4d8-57ac-4e0c-8101-7e721f9930ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8d2e8daca08b65331fb3f0dd0478256 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1643674b/uploads/origins/8580f4d8-57ac-4e0c-8101-7e721f9930ea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a6ff650b1ad1b9944ac17cb7acf678b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!! I love your artstyle! I would like to commission my VTuber character in a cute summer swimsuit~ the design is up to you! Below are the character details ~\n\nReference: See URL\n\nMaygi is a kind and shy magical girl who loves helping others, but can be clumsy at times. She has starry eyes and blonde highlights on her side bangs and tips of hair. Her outfit is themed around wishes and hope, with shooting stars and wings as a common theme.\n\nhttps://prnt.sc/tNcC_HzTYPD8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@strawberry0824s/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c98de3f9/uploads/origins/993156d5-f63d-4421-9fff-10027898be61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec37dc633248aa370e75f464773648c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c98de3f9/uploads/origins